# ============================================================================
# PROPRIETARY COGNITIVE TEST ASSETS
# ============================================================================
# This section excludes closed-source IQ test materials based on the ICAR
# project (International Cognitive Ability Resource). These materials contain
# proprietary test questions, images, and scoring logic.
#
# For access to these materials, please visit: https://icar-project.com/
#
# To configure your own cognitive tests:
# 1. Replace the assets in public/CognitiveAssets/ with your test materials
# 2. Update src/components/psychometrics/IQTest.tsx with your test logic
# 3. Uncomment the lines below if you want to track your custom assets
# ============================================================================

# Cognitive test images and assets (ICAR-based proprietary content)
public/CognitiveAssets/
# Uncomment below to track your own cognitive assets:
!public/CognitiveAssets/README.md

# Medical Dataset (Knee Osteoarthritis Severity Grading Dataset)
public/dataset/
# Uncomment below to track the dataset documentation:
!public/dataset/README.md

# Sensitive Documents
public/DataProtection.pdf

# Data Visualizer outputs (contains sensitive exported data)
public/scripts/outputs/

